- production build: **PASS**;
- browser runtime smoke: **PASS**;
- progressive hero-camera runtime probe: **PASS**;
- all twelve room evidence and traversal jobs: **PASS**.

### Runtime synchronization results

| Room | Acquisition | Tracking | Locked | Layer | Browser errors |
|---|---|---|---|---:|---:|
| 02 | 38.00 deg, 192x108 @ 8 FPS | 384x216 @ 14 FPS | 0.00 deg, 512x288 @ 18 FPS | 7 | 0 |
| 04 | 38.00 deg, 192x108 @ 8 FPS | 384x216 @ 14 FPS | 0.00 deg, 512x288 @ 18 FPS | 8 | 0 |
| 06 | 38.00 deg, 192x108 @ 8 FPS | 384x216 @ 14 FPS | 0.00 deg, 512x288 @ 18 FPS | 9 | 0 |

Every room recorded all three phases and all three balanced-tier resolutions. Lock required three stable rendered tracking samples rather than elapsed time alone.

